as the waiter whispered to Betty. Lissa was too worried about her crisp to be embarrassed.

47
00:05:41.273 --> 00:05:50.513
Betty walked over to Lissa with a sympathetic expression. "I'm sorry, but I don't think we

48
00:05:50.514 --> 00:05:58.417
can bring the pan back from the oven now. No second chances, I'm afraid. Besides that, the

49
00:05:58.418 --> 00:06:10.422
