56
00:06:56.269 --> 00:07:02.105
thought. She'd gotten completely distracted by the other bakers, especially Mia. It was too late now.

57
00:07:02.106 --> 00:07:12.203
Lissa made the yogurt sauce extra sweet, but she knew it wouldn't make up for the cherries'

58
00:07:12.204 --> 00:07:21.028
tartness. She dripped the sauce onto the crisp and then sat down to wait for the

59
00:07:21.029 --> 00:07:28.180
judging. She had been so sure she could win this baking round. Instead she had failed

60
00:07:28.181 --> 00:07:36.674
miserably. *** After all the desserts had been baked and cooled, the judges began tasting them.

61
00:07:36.675 --> 00:07:48.002
They raved over Kelly's peach cake and Rob's cranberry cookies. "Delicious!" one said about Mia's rhubarb

62
00:07:48.003 --> 00:07:55.096
